{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g_C","type":"group","x":6400,"y":2340,"width":2860,"height":5703,"color":"6","label":"C · 单次 AF：模块与命令序列"},
		{"id":"g_A","type":"group","x":0,"y":2340,"width":2860,"height":5408,"color":"6","label":"A · 图像初始化：模块与状态"},
		{"id":"g_pyramid","type":"group","x":-100,"y":-80,"width":7800,"height":1960,"color":"6","label":"主体：先从上到下，再沿六个功能区从左到右"},
		{"id":"g_F","type":"group","x":6400,"y":8493,"width":2860,"height":3815,"color":"6","label":"F · 入口对齐与像素打包"},
		{"id":"g_N","type":"group","x":3200,"y":20053,"width":2860,"height":3510,"color":"6","label":"N · 版本、参数、证据与复现"},
		{"id":"g_E","type":"group","x":3200,"y":8493,"width":2860,"height":3433,"color":"6","label":"E · DVP 与异步 FIFO：采集和跨域"},
		{"id":"g_G","type":"group","x":0,"y":12758,"width":2860,"height":3305,"color":"6","label":"G · AXI 写：帧提交与错误出口"},
		{"id":"g_K","type":"group","x":3200,"y":16513,"width":2860,"height":3090,"color":"6","label":"K · TMDS：编码、串行和差分输出"},
		{"id":"g_M","type":"group","x":0,"y":20053,"width":2860,"height":3081,"color":"6","label":"M · 板级引脚与约束"},
		{"id":"g_J","type":"group","x":0,"y":16513,"width":2860,"height":2970,"color":"6","label":"J · 显示侧：扫描、拆包和欠载"},
		{"id":"g_I","type":"group","x":6400,"y":12758,"width":2860,"height":2955,"color":"6","label":"I · AXI 读：预取和安全换帧"},
		{"id":"g_H","type":"group","x":3200,"y":12758,"width":2860,"height":2722,"color":"6","label":"H · 三缓冲与 DDR：归属和发布"},
		{"id":"g_D","type":"group","x":0,"y":8493,"width":2860,"height":2645,"color":"6","label":"D · AF 事务引擎：状态与超时"},
		{"id":"g_L","type":"group","x":6400,"y":16513,"width":2860,"height":2383,"color":"6","label":"L · 公共时钟、复位及 IP"},
		{"id":"g_B","type":"group","x":3200,"y":2340,"width":2860,"height":2135,"color":"6","label":"B · SCCB：唯一主机与读写事务"},
		{"id":"g_O","type":"group","x":0,"y":24013,"width":4380,"height":560,"color":"6","label":"O · 专项横向关系：写、帧归属、读；完整接口见 G/H/I 区"},
		{"id":"sensor","type":"text","text":"## A01 · 01 OV5640 传感器\n\n输入：24 MHz XCLK、SCL/SDA 配置。  \n输出：PCLK、VSYNC、HREF、DATA[7:0]。  \nDVP 按两字节输出一个 RGB565 像素。  \n内部 AF MCU 控制能力与实物 VCM 是否存在，是不同问题。  ","x":110,"y":2470,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"camwrap","type":"text","text":"## A02 · ov5640_af_camera / cam\n\n`rtl/camera_af/ov5640_af_camera.v`  \n\n目的：组合时钟、图像初始化、AF 和唯一 SCCB 主机。  \n图像配置用 image_init；完成后 af_owner 切换到 autofocus。  \ninit_done 只表示图像初始化，不与 AF 成功相与。  \nAF 失败不重置 capture、DDR 或显示。  \n板上 RST/PWDN 拉定，内部相应输出未接 PL 引脚。  ","x":1630,"y":2470,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"imagerom","type":"text","text":"## A04 · ov5640_init_table_rgb / image_rom\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/imports/camera_init/ov5640_init_table_rgb.v`  \n\n同步读：cfg_addr[7:0] → cfg_data[23:0]。  \n高 16 位寄存器地址，低 8 位数据；有效 0…251。  \n本版参数 1280×720；0x3808/09=0x0500，0x380A/B=0x02D0。  \nRGB565：0x4300=0x61、0x501F=0x01；VSYNC 配置 0x4740=0x20。  \n写 VCM control 项不等于电机存在，也不等于 AF 固件已加载。  ","x":110,"y":2995,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"iwait","type":"text","text":"## A05 · ST_WAIT_CLOCK\n\n等待 camera_clk_ready；就绪后开始复位保持。  ","x":110,"y":3520,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ihard","type":"text","text":"## A06 · ST_HARD_RESET\n\ncamera_rst_n 保持低；计数到 RESET_CYCLES 后拉高。板上未连接该输出。  ","x":1630,"y":3520,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"istartup","type":"text","text":"## A07 · ST_STARTUP_WAIT\n\n等待 STARTUP_CYCLES；准备读取 ID 高字节，释放 SCCB 复位。  ","x":1630,"y":4030,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"irequest","type":"text","text":"## A08 · ST_REQUEST\n\nbus_busy=0 时 bus_start 单拍 → ST_WAIT_BUS；等忙超时则 ERROR。  ","x":110,"y":4030,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ibus","type":"text","text":"## A09 · ST_WAIT_BUS\n\n等 bus_done；NACK/超时 → ERROR。ID 高字节后再读低字节；ID 不匹配 → ERROR。  ","x":110,"y":4540,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"irom1","type":"text","text":"## A10 · ST_ROM_WAIT_1\n\ncfg_addr 已设定，等待同步 ROM。  ","x":1630,"y":4540,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"irom2","type":"text","text":"## A11 · ST_ROM_WAIT_2\n\n再等一拍，保证 cfg_data 稳定。  ","x":1630,"y":5050,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"iprep","type":"text","text":"## A12 · ST_PREPARE_WRITE\n\n锁存 cfg_data 地址和数据，job=CONFIG → REQUEST。  ","x":110,"y":5050,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"idelay","type":"text","text":"## A13 · ST_WRITE_DELAY\n\n写完后等待：软复位项 5 ms，其他 100 μs。最后一项后置 init_done，否则 cfg_addr++。  ","x":110,"y":5560,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"idone","type":"text","text":"## A14 · ST_DONE\n\n保持 init_done=1；wrapper 令 af_owner=1，将事务接口交给 AF。  ","x":1630,"y":5560,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ierror","type":"text","text":"## A15 · ST_ERROR\n\n停止初始化；保持 bus_reset。错误码：1 NACK、2 ID 不符、3 总线等待超时。  ","x":1630,"y":6070,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ref_A_0","type":"text","text":"## A · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nA04 → A03：cfg_data ←；cfg_addr →  \n\nA09 → A08：ID 高字节完成，读低字节  \n\nA12 → A08：准备写事务  \n\nA09 → A13：配置写完成  \n\nA13 → A10：还有配置，地址+1  \n\nA09 → A15：NACK / 超时 / ID错误  \n\nA03 → A05：展开图像初始化状态  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nA01 → E01：PCLK / VS / HREF / D[7:0]  ","x":110,"y":6580,"width":2640,"height":655,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ref_A_9","type":"text","text":"## A · 条件、回环与跨区接口 2\n\nA03 → B01：af_owner=0：图像事务  \n\nA02 → E01：camera_done 释放采集，不等待 AF  \n\nA14 → C01：af_owner 交接后释放 AF 控制器  ","x":110,"y":7335,"width":2640,"height":283,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"sccb","type":"text","text":"## B01 · sccb_master / shared_master\n\n`rtl/camera/sccb_master.v`  \n\n地址 DEVICE_ADDR=0x3C；在线写地址 0x78、读地址 0x79。  \n请求输入：start、read_enable、reg_addr[15:0]、write_data[7:0]。  \n接受后锁存参数，busy=1；STOP 后 done 单拍，nack_error 保留本次结果。  \nSDA 只主动拉低或释放为 Z；SCL 由本机驱动，不实现 clock stretching。  ","x":3310,"y":2470,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tick","type":"text","text":"## B02 · SCCB：四节拍发生器\n\nTICK_CYCLES=50MHz/(100kHz×4)=125。  \n计数 0…124 共 125 个系统周期，再回 0。  \nsccb_tick=400 kHz 使能脉冲，不是另建一个时钟域。  \n四个 tick 组成一位 SCL 周期，SCL=100 kHz。  ","x":4830,"y":2470,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"phase","type":"text","text":"## B03 · SCCB：每个数据位的四阶段\n\nphase0：SCL 低，准备或释放 SDA。  \nphase1：SCL 拉高。  \nphase2：保持高，ACK/READ 在此采样 SDA 两级同步结果。  \nphase3：SCL 拉低，推进位/字节/状态。  ","x":4830,"y":2980,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sccbwrite","type":"text","text":"## B04 · 写寄存器事务\n\nIDLE —start→ START → SEND → ACK。  \n依次发送：0x78 → 地址高字节 → 地址低字节 → 数据字节。  \n每字节 MSB 先发；每字节后 ACK。  \n任何从机 NACK → STOP；正常最后数据 ACK → STOP。  ","x":3310,"y":2980,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sccb_read","type":"text","text":"## B05 · 读寄存器事务\n\n先写 0x78、寄存器高/低地址。  \n地址 ACK 后 → RESTART → SEND 0x79 → ACK → READ 8 位。  \nREAD_NACK：主机释放 SDA 表示不继续读；这是正常读尾，不是 nack_error。  \nSTOP：SCL 高期间释放 SDA，busy 清零，done 拉高一拍。  ","x":3310,"y":3490,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ref_B_0","type":"text","text":"## B · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nB03 → B04：read_enable=0：写事务  \n\nB03 → B05：read_enable=1  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nB01 → A01：SCL U22 / SDA T22  ","x":3310,"y":4000,"width":2640,"height":345,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"afctrl","type":"text","text":"## C01 · ov5640_af_ctrl / autofocus\n\n`rtl/camera_af/ov5640_af_ctrl.v`  \n\n目的：加载匹配固件并执行单次自动对焦。  \n输出：bus_reset/start/read/addr/write_data；读事务响应。  \naf_ready：固件 idle；af_busy：加载或聚焦；af_done：结束单拍。  \naf_success：状态寄存器返回 0x10；af_error/error_code：失败原因。  \n无自动重试；FAILED 保留至系统复位。  ","x":6510,"y":2470,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"afrom","type":"text","text":"## C02 · ov5640_af_rom / firmware_rom\n\n`rtl/camera_af/ov5640_af_rom.v`  \n\n同步 ROM：firmware_addr[11:0] → firmware_data[7:0]。  \n4077 有效字节，.mem 补齐至 4096；只上传有效区。  \nEspressif 官方 esp32-camera 提交 281d951f75b6559adec3cdb8cf076366da103880。  \n原头文件、参考驱动、LICENSE、哈希：third_party/ov5640_af/。  \nROM 文件 rtl/camera_af/ov5640_af_firmware.mem。  ","x":8030,"y":2470,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af0","type":"text","text":"## C03 · step 0：复位摄像头 MCU\n\n写 0x3000=0x20；不重置 FPGA 视频通路。  ","x":8030,"y":2995,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af1","type":"text","text":"## C04 · step 1：逐字节上传固件\n\n地址 0x8000+byte_index；ROM 数据；index 0…4076。每字节等待事务完成后再推进。  ","x":6510,"y":2995,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af2","type":"text","text":"## C05 · step 2：清命令区\n\nclear_index 0…6，写 0x3022…0x3028=0。  ","x":6510,"y":3505,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af3","type":"text","text":"## C06 · step 3：设置固件启动标志\n\n写 0x3029=0x7F。  ","x":8030,"y":3505,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af4","type":"text","text":"## C07 · step 4：启动 MCU\n\n写 0x3000=0，进入固件状态轮询。  ","x":8030,"y":4015,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af5","type":"text","text":"## C08 · step 5：等待固件 idle\n\n读 0x3029；0x70 → af_ready=1。否则每 5 ms 再读，2 s 未就绪则 error=3。  ","x":6510,"y":4015,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af6","type":"text","text":"## C09 · SETTLE → step 6\n\n等待 200 ms，然后写 CMD_MAIN 0x3022=0x01。  ","x":6510,"y":4525,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af7","type":"text","text":"## C10 · step 7：释放焦点命令\n\n写 CMD_MAIN 0x3022=0x08；遵循固定上游驱动顺序。  ","x":8030,"y":4525,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af8","type":"text","text":"## C11 · step 8：等释放命令结束\n\n读 CMD_ACK 0x3023，清零则下一步；非零隔 5 ms 轮询，超时 error=4。  ","x":8030,"y":5035,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af9","type":"text","text":"## C12 · step 9：设置命令握手\n\n写 CMD_ACK 0x3023=0x01。  ","x":6510,"y":5035,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af10","type":"text","text":"## C13 · step 10：触发单次对焦\n\n写 CMD_MAIN 0x3022=0x03，不是持续对焦命令。  ","x":6510,"y":5545,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af11","type":"text","text":"## C14 · step 11：等对焦命令 ACK\n\n读 0x3023=0 后进入状态轮询，非零则继续等待；超时 error=4。  ","x":8030,"y":5545,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"af12","type":"text","text":"## C15 · step 12：读取聚焦状态\n\n读 0x3029；0x10 → af_success=1、af_done 单拍、af_busy=0。对焦 ACK 与此状态轮询连续计时，上限 5 s；超时 error=5。  ","x":8030,"y":6055,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ref_C_0","type":"text","text":"## C · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nC03 → C04：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC04 → C05：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC05 → C06：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC06 → C07：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC07 → C08：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC08 → C09：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC09 → C10：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC10 → C11：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC11 → C12：成功后进入下一 step  ","x":6510,"y":6565,"width":2640,"height":655,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ref_C_9","type":"text","text":"## C · 条件、回环与跨区接口 2\n\nC12 → C13：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC13 → C14：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC14 → C15：成功后进入下一 step  \n\nC01 → C03：展开命令序列  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nC01 → B01：af_owner=1：AF 事务  \n\nC01 → D01：展开事务状态机  \n\nC15 → N06：固件结果 → LED；不是镜头运动测量  ","x":6510,"y":7320,"width":2640,"height":593,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"aswait","type":"text","text":"## D01 · WAIT_IMAGE\n\nimage_ready 后：bus_reset=0、af_busy=1、step=0 → ROM_WAIT。  ","x":110,"y":8623,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"asrom","type":"text","text":"## D02 · ROM_WAIT\n\n等一整拍同步 ROM；之后进入 PLAN，避免读到上一个 byte_index 的值。  ","x":1630,"y":8623,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"asplan","type":"text","text":"## D03 · PLAN\n\n根据 step 锁存 bus_read/addr/write_data，清事务计时 → REQUEST。  ","x":1630,"y":9133,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"asrequest","type":"text","text":"## D04 · REQUEST\n\n等 bus_busy=0，发 bus_start 单拍 → BUS_WAIT；等待超时 error=2。  ","x":110,"y":9133,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"asbus","type":"text","text":"## D05 · BUS_WAIT\n\nbus_done 后更新 step/index。NACK error=1；事务超时 error=2。未满足轮询条件 → POLL_WAIT。  ","x":110,"y":9643,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"aspoll","type":"text","text":"## D06 · POLL_WAIT / SETTLE\n\nPOLL_WAIT 等 5 ms → ROM_WAIT；SETTLE 等 200 ms → ROM_WAIT。轮询期限包括事务和间隔。  ","x":1630,"y":9643,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"asready","type":"text","text":"## D07 · READY\n\n保留 af_ready/af_success。focus_start 上升沿可再发单次请求，但本顶层将其接 0。  ","x":1630,"y":10153,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"asfailed","type":"text","text":"## D08 · FAILED\n\naf_error=1、af_done 单拍、af_busy=0、af_success=0。总线超时额外置 bus_reset，其他失败不复位视频。  ","x":110,"y":10153,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ref_D_0","type":"text","text":"## D · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nD05 → D02：普通事务完成，推进 step  \n\nD06 → D02：间隔结束  \n\nD05 → D07：step12 返回 0x10  \n\nD07 → D02：focus_start 上升沿，step=6  ","x":110,"y":10663,"width":2640,"height":345,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"capture","type":"text","text":"## E01 · 02 ov5640_capture / capture\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/ov5640_capture.v`  \n\n目的：找到帧边界并组合像素。  \n时钟：PCLK；capture_reset=sys_reset || !camera_done。  \n输入：VSYNC、HREF、DATA[7:0]。  \n输出：sof、pv、pd[15:0]，均属于 PCLK 域。  \nVSYNC_ACTIVE_HIGH=1；FIRST_BYTE_IS_HIGH=1。  ","x":3310,"y":8623,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ingress","type":"text","text":"## E02 · 03 camera_ingress / ingress\n\n`rtl/camera/camera_ingress.v`  \n\n目的：给第一颗入队像素附 SOF，并管理丢帧。  \n输入：frame_start、pixel_valid、pixel_data。  \n输出：cq_data[16:0]、cq_empty；消费：cq_pop。  \n内部实例 q：17 位 × 2048 RAM 槽。  \noverflow_seen 是历史锁存诊断，不会阻止下一帧恢复。  ","x":4830,"y":8623,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"fifoimpl","type":"text","text":"## E03 · stream_async_fifo：两处实例共用的实现\n\n`rtl/camera/stream_async_fifo.v`  \n\n输入：reset、wr_clk、din、wr_en、rd_clk、rd_en。  \n输出：full、dout、empty。  \n存储：真双口 BRAM；二进制指针寻址，Gray 指针跨域。  \nRAM 中 2^ADDR_BITS 槽 + 读端预取寄存器一槽。  \n不是 FIFO Generator 的 camera_pixel_fifo IP。  ","x":4830,"y":9148,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"creset","type":"text","text":"## E04 · 采集：复位与等待首帧\n\ncapture_reset 在 PCLK 域同步释放。vsync_seen 初始 0；先看到有效 VSYNC 后才接受帧边界。capture_enabled 在首个边界后置 1。  ","x":3310,"y":9148,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cframe","type":"text","text":"## E05 · 采集：帧边界\n\nvsync_active=VSYNC；frame_boundary=seen && active_d && !active。  \nframe_start_reg 寄存该事件，输出 sof。VSYNC 有效期清 byte_pending，不接收图像字节。  ","x":3310,"y":9673,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cbytes","type":"text","text":"## E06 · 采集：HREF 和字节配对\n\nHREF=0 清 byte_pending，不让两行拼成一个像素。  \nHREF=1 且无半像素：锁存 first_byte。下一有效字节：pd={first_byte,camera_data}，pv=1 一拍。  \n如果首字节与 frame_boundary 同拍，也会先保存该字节。  ","x":4830,"y":9673,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ingressrules","type":"text","text":"## E07 · 入口：pending / enabled / dropping\n\nframe_start：pending=1、enabled=1、dropping=0。  \npush=pixel_valid && (enabled||SOF) && (!dropping||SOF) && !full。  \n入队项={pending||SOF,pixel_data}，成功 push 后清 pending。  \n符合写条件但 full=1：dropping=1、pending=0、overflow_seen=1。  \n当前帧后续像素丢弃；下一 SOF 清 dropping 恢复。  ","x":4830,"y":10183,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"fifowrite","type":"text","text":"## E08 · FIFO 写指针与 full\n\n有效写入：wr_en && !full && !wrs[2]。  \nwn=wb+有效写；gn=(wn>>1)^wn。  \n读 Gray 指针 rg 经 rg1/rg2 两级同步到写域。  \nfull=(gn == {翻转 rg2 最高两位,其余位})。  \n本地复位释放前保持 full=1，防止提前写入。  ","x":3310,"y":10183,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"fiforead","type":"text","text":"## E09 · FIFO 读预取与 empty\n\n写 Gray 指针 wg 经 wg1/wg2 两级同步到读域。  \nram_empty=(rg==wg2)。  \n当 !valid || rd_en 时，若 RAM 非空，同步读取 mem[rb] 并推进读指针，valid=1。  \n若无数据则 valid=0；empty=!valid || rrs[2]。  \n队头 dout 在 empty=0 时可见，rd_en 消费它。  ","x":3310,"y":10693,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cdc","type":"text","text":"## E10 · 跨时钟不是直接传多位总线\n\n入口：PCLK → ui_clk；显示：ui_clk → pixel_clk。  \nGray 指针的第一同步级有 max_delay -datapath_only 5 ns；不靠全局假路径掩盖整个跨域。  \nreset 分别同步释放到写域和读域。  \nfull 属于写域，empty 属于读域；多位像素通过 RAM，不逐位打同步器。  ","x":4830,"y":10693,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ref_E_0","type":"text","text":"## E · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nE01 → E02：sof / pv / pd[15:0]  \n\nE02 → E03：内部 q：17 位 / ADDR_BITS=11  \n\nE03 → E08：写域机制  \n\nE02 → E07：写入与丢帧规则  \n\nE07 → E05：恢复依赖下一 SOF  \n\nE10 → E03：跨域实现依据  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nE02 → F01：cq_data[16:0] / empty  ","x":3310,"y":11203,"width":2640,"height":593,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"front","type":"text","text":"## F01 · 04 顶层入口：帧申请与对齐\n\n目的：从有效 SOF 开始，交付恰好一帧。  \n状态：SEEK / COMMAND / STREAM / DRAIN。  \ncap_req/cap_ack 申请缓存；wstart/wstart_ready 接收写命令。  \ninput_pixels 仅在 cq_pop 时递增。  \npack_reset=ui_reset || 非 STREAM || premature_sof。  ","x":6510,"y":8623,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"packer","type":"text","text":"## F02 · 05 rgb565_packer / packer\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/rgb565_packer.v`  \n\n输入：in_pixel[15:0]、in_frame_start、in_valid/in_ready。  \n输出：128 位数据、16 位 strobe、SOF、EOF、valid/ready。  \n每 8 像素组成一拍；按像素总数标帧尾。  \n复位已改为仅 posedge clk 同步采样。  ","x":8030,"y":8623,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"seek","type":"text","text":"## F03 · SEEK：寻找合法帧首\n\n队头非空且无 SOF：cq_pop=1，丢弃。  \n队头为 SOF：cap_req=1，等 cap_ack。握手后 input_pixels=0，进入 COMMAND；此刻不取走帧头。  ","x":8030,"y":9133,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"command","type":"text","text":"## F04 · COMMAND：等写入命令接收\n\nwstart && wstart_ready → STREAM。  \n管理器已预留缓存并提供 wbase，writer 开始接收本帧。  ","x":6510,"y":9133,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"stream","type":"text","text":"## F05 · STREAM：有背压地交付像素\n\nfeed=STREAM && input_pixels<FRAME_PIXELS && !premature_sof。  \ncq_pop=feed && !cq_empty && pack_ready；每次 pop 计数加一。  \nwdone → SEEK；premature_sof → DRAIN。  ","x":6510,"y":9643,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"drain","type":"text","text":"## F06 · DRAIN：等待中止结束\n\npremature_sof=STREAM && input_pixels!=0 && !empty && cq_data[16]。  \n不消费新帧头；等待 writer 排完事务并 wdone，再回 SEEK。  \n新 SOF 留在队头，可作为下一帧起点。  ","x":8030,"y":9643,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"packready","type":"text","text":"## F07 · 打包器：背压\n\nin_ready=!reset && (!out_valid || out_ready)。  \n下游不接收且 out_valid=1 时，输出保持，停止接受新像素。  \n传输定义为 in_valid && in_ready。  ","x":8030,"y":10153,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"packlane","type":"text","text":"## F08 · 打包器：位槽与 strobe\n\nlane_count=0…7；pixel0 → [15:0]，pixel7 → [127:112]。  \n每接收一像素设置对应两位 pack_strb。  \nSOF 重开新组并记 pack_frame_start；没有 SOF 且 frame_active=0 时不组帧。  ","x":6510,"y":10153,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"packlast","type":"text","text":"## F09 · 打包器：何时输出\n\n收到第 8 颗像素，或本帧最后一颗像素 → out_valid=1。  \n首拍 out_frame_start=1；最后像素编号 FRAME_PIXELS−1 → out_frame_last=1。  \n本版帧长可整除 8，所有拍 strobe=0xFFFF；模块仍支持一般尾拍。  ","x":6510,"y":10663,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"packfix","type":"text","text":"## F10 · 黑屏修正：同步采样业务清理\n\n旧逻辑用组合 premature_sof 驱动异步清零。首像素计数 0→1 与队头 SOF 1→0 传播不同步，可能误清帧头。  \n现在 always @(posedge clk)，时钟沿间短毛刺不立即清状态。  \n改后上板出图支持该解释，但没有内部毛刺波形直接证据。  ","x":8030,"y":10663,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ref_F_0","type":"text","text":"## F · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nF04 → F05：wstart && wstart_ready  \n\nF01 → F03：内部状态  \n\nF05 → F03：完整写入 wdone  \n\nF02 → F07：内部逻辑  \n\nF10 → F01：pack_reset 仍保留，变为同步采样  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nF02 → G01：128 位 + STRB / SOF / EOF  \n\nF06 → G01：abort_frame  \n\nF01 → H01：cap_req / cap_ack  ","x":6510,"y":11173,"width":2640,"height":655,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ref_F_9","type":"text","text":"## F · 条件、回环与跨区接口 2\n\nF06 → G05：若未提交突发，直接放弃；否则先排完  ","x":6510,"y":11928,"width":2640,"height":250,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"writer","type":"text","text":"## G01 · 06 axi_frame_writer / writer\n\n`rtl/camera/axi_frame_writer.v`  \n\n输入：wstart/wbase；packer 数据和标志。  \n输出：AXI AW/W，接收 B；完成反馈 wdone/werror。  \n一次最多 16 拍，先收集后发地址；每次只保留一个写事务。  \n提前 SOF 使用 abort_frame，不撤销已提出的 AW。  ","x":110,"y":12888,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"axi_summary","type":"text","text":"## G02 · AXI 五通道：握手定义\n\nAW：写地址和突发属性；W：写数据/WSTRB/WLAST；B：写响应。  \nAR：读地址和突发属性；R：读数据/响应/RLAST。  \n每次传输由 VALID && READY 定义，不是五个固定依次执行的“动作”。  \nVALID 一旦提出就保持到接收，payload 在等待期间保持。  \n本项目为了简单，一次一个写突发、一次一个读突发。  \n一拍=16字节；WLAST/RLAST 是突发尾，不自动等于帧尾。  ","x":1630,"y":12888,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"widle","type":"text","text":"## G03 · ST_IDLE：接收帧命令\n\nframe_start_ready=DDR ready && IDLE && 非 reset。  \n基址必须 16 字节对齐，末地址不越 28 位空间；否则 wdone+werror。  \n有效命令锁存地址、剩余拍数、first_word → PREPARE。  ","x":1630,"y":13398,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"wprepare","type":"text","text":"## G04 · ST_PREPARE：决定本次突发\n\nburst_beats=min(16, beats_remaining, (4096−addr[11:0])/16)。  \nburst_is_last=(剩余拍数==本次拍数)。  \ncollect_index/send_index=0 → COLLECT。  ","x":110,"y":13398,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"wcollect","type":"text","text":"## G05 · ST_COLLECT：先收齐数据\n\nin_ready=1；锁存 data/strb 到 16 拍数组。  \n核对 SOF 是否仅首拍、EOF 是否最后拍、WSTRB 是否正确。  \n格式错误或 abort/cancel：wdone+werror → IDLE。  \n收齐本突发 → AW。  ","x":110,"y":13908,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"waw","type":"text","text":"## G06 · ST_AW：地址通道\n\nAWVALID=1，等 AWREADY，不因 abort 撤销已提出的地址。  \nAWADDR=write_addr，AWLEN=burst_beats−1，AWSIZE=4，AWBURST=INCR，ID=0。  \n握手 → W。  ","x":1630,"y":13908,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ww","type":"text","text":"## G07 · ST_W：数据通道\n\nWVALID=1；只在 WREADY 时推进 send_index。  \nW 一拍 16 字节；最后一拍 WLAST=1。  \n最后一拍完成 → B。  ","x":1630,"y":14418,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"wb","type":"text","text":"## G08 · ST_B：等待写响应\n\nBREADY=1；等 BVALID。  \nBRESP 非 OKAY、BID 非0、cancel/abort → wdone+werror → IDLE。  \n最后突发成功 → wdone，error=0 → IDLE。  \n否则 addr += burst_beats×16，remaining -= burst_beats → PREPARE。  ","x":110,"y":14418,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ref_G_0","type":"text","text":"## G · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nG05 → G06：收齐本突发且格式正确  \n\nG07 → G08：WVALID && WREADY && WLAST  \n\nG01 → G03：展开写入状态  \n\nG08 → G04：本帧未结束  \n\nG08 → G03：最后突发成功或写错误  \n\nG05 → G03：abort / 格式错误，尚未提交地址  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nG01 → H02：AW / W / B  \n\nG01 → H01：wdone / werror  ","x":110,"y":14928,"width":2640,"height":655,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ref_G_9","type":"text","text":"## G · 条件、回环与跨区接口 2\n\nG08 → H01：完成或失败通知  \n\nG02 → I01：读端应用  ","x":110,"y":15683,"width":2640,"height":250,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"manager","type":"text","text":"## H01 · frame_buffer_manager / manager\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/frame_buffer_manager.v`  \n\n输入 cap_req、wdone/werror、显示请求与确认。  \n输出 cap_ack、wstart/wbase、显示 cfg/base/has_frame。  \n三个 buffer_state：FREE / WRITING / READY / PENDING / DISPLAY。  \n选择最低编号 FREE；显示优先选 latest_ready_id。  \nwrite_buffer_id、writer_active、current_display_id、pending_display_id 记录归属。  ","x":3310,"y":12888,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ddr","type":"text","text":"## H02 · 07 ddr_controller / ddr\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/ddr_controller.v`  \n\n目的：封装时钟、AXI 复位与 MIG。  \n所有 AXI 通道属于 ui_clk=100 MHz 域。  \n连接 writer 的 AW/W/B 和 reader 的 AR/R。  \n输出 init_calib_complete；校准前上层不发新事务。  \nMIG 控制外部 DDR3L，图像不整帧放在 BRAM。  ","x":4830,"y":12888,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"migrate","type":"text","text":"## H03 · MIG：AXI → DDR3L 物理接口\n\nFPGA XC7Z020 CLG484 -2；DDR 数据 16 位、时钟 400 MHz。  \nAXI 数据 128 位、地址 28 位、ID 4 位；UI 100 MHz。  \n物理芯片原理图 MT41K128M16JT-125:K，1.35 V。  \n使用库内 MT41K128M16XX-15E 模板在 400 MHz 工作；这不是重新识别物理芯片。  \nSSTL135 / DIFF_SSTL135；Bank35 VREF=0.675 V。  \n刷新/ZQ 等维护交给 MIG；手动 app_sr/ref/zq_req 接 0。  ","x":4830,"y":13413,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"bfree","type":"text","text":"## H04 · FREE → WRITING\n\ncapture_request_ready = 非 reset、DDR ready、无 capture_busy、找到 FREE。  \ncap_req && cap_ack：预留 free_id，置 writer_start_valid、writer_base_addr。  ","x":3310,"y":13413,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bwrite","type":"text","text":"## H05 · WRITING → READY 或 FREE\n\nwriter_done && writer_active：释放 writer_active。  \n成功：completed_frame_count++，新缓存 READY，淘汰其他旧 READY。  \n失败：failed_frame_count++，本缓存 FREE，不发布。  ","x":3310,"y":13923,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bready","type":"text","text":"## H06 · READY → PENDING\n\ndisplay_request_valid && ready：若有新完整帧，选最新 READY，置 PENDING、display_has_frame=1，并发 config_valid。  ","x":4830,"y":13923,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bpending","type":"text","text":"## H07 · PENDING → DISPLAY\n\ndisplay_config_valid && config_ready：确认切换，释放旧 DISPLAY，pending 缓存变成 DISPLAY。  \n前提由 reader 保证：旧事务和旧预取数据已处理完。  ","x":4830,"y":14433,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"brepeat","type":"text","text":"## H08 · 没有新 READY 帧\n\n继续当前 DISPLAY 的 base 和 valid；首次没有任何完整帧则 has_frame=0。  \n当前显示缓存绝不会被采集申请为 FREE。  ","x":3310,"y":14433,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ref_H_0","type":"text","text":"## H · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nH08 → H06：下一次显示请求再选择  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nH02 → I01：RDATA[127:0] / RVALID / RREADY / RLAST  \n\nH01 → G01：wstart / wbase  \n\nH01 → I01：disp_cfg / disp_base / disp_has  ","x":3310,"y":14943,"width":2640,"height":407,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"reader","type":"text","text":"## I01 · 08 axi_display_reader / reader\n\n`rtl/camera/axi_display_reader.v`  \n\n输入：显示请求 toggle、帧配置、AXI R。  \n输出：AR 请求、显示 FIFO 数据/写使能、FIFO 复位。  \n一次一个在途 INCR 读突发；最多 16 拍，不跨 4 KiB。  \n新显示请求先排完已接受事务，再清队列换帧。  ","x":6510,"y":12888,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"rwait","type":"text","text":"## I02 · WAIT：等待显示请求\n\npixel VSYNC 上升沿翻转 display_toggle。req_sync 三拍同步到 UI；event_req=(同步值!=seen)。  \npending/event_req 且 DDR ready：置 FIFO reset，清计时 → FLUSH。  ","x":8030,"y":12888,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rflush","type":"text","text":"## I03 · FLUSH：清预取队列\n\nhold_count 到 15 → REQ。  \n该阶段旧 R 事务已结束；FIFO 两域指针与预取有效位被清理。  ","x":8030,"y":13398,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rreq","type":"text","text":"## I04 · REQ → CFG：申请显示帧\n\nconfig_request 与 manager ready 握手 → CFG。  \nconfig_valid：锁存 base，remaining=115200，清 read_error、释放 fifo_reset。  \nhas_frame=0 → WAIT；有帧 → PREP。  ","x":6510,"y":13398,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rprep","type":"text","text":"## I05 · PREP：准备读突发\n\n有新换帧请求 → WAIT，先进入清队列流程。  \n释放后再等待 hold_count；队列非满时确定 burst=min(16,remaining,4KiB边界拍数) → AR。  ","x":6510,"y":13908,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rar","type":"text","text":"## I06 · AR：提交读地址\n\nARVALID 保持到 ARREADY；ARLEN=burst−1。  \n顶层固定 ARID=0，ARSIZE=4，ARBURST=INCR。  \n即使新帧事件到来，也不撤销已提出地址；握手 → R。  ","x":8030,"y":13908,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rr","type":"text","text":"## I07 · R：接收与核对\n\nRREADY=(aborting || !fifo_full)。  \n新帧事件后仍接收在途返回，但丢弃而不写 FIFO。  \n正常 RVALID/RREADY 且 RRESP=0、无 read_error 才 fifo_push。  \n核对 RLAST 与 received==burst−1；错误只报告，不发布坏数据。  ","x":8030,"y":14418,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"rend","type":"text","text":"## I08 · R 突发结束的分支\n\nRLAST 后：换帧、已有错误、当前响应错误或长度不符 → WAIT。  \n本帧 remaining==burst → WAIT。  \n否则 remaining -= burst；address += burst×16 → PREP。  \n无法响应的存储器不靠非法撤销 AXI 来强行恢复。  ","x":6510,"y":14418,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ref_I_0","type":"text","text":"## I · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nI02 → I03：新请求/pending && DDR ready  \n\nI04 → I05：CFG 收到 config_valid && has_frame  \n\nI05 → I06：等待结束、无新请求且 FIFO 非满  \n\nI07 → I08：RVALID && RREADY && RLAST  \n\nI08 → I02：完成、错误或换帧  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nI01 → J01：128 位 / fifo_push  \n\nI01 → H01：disp_req / config_ready  \n\nI01 → H02：ARADDR / ARLEN / ARVALID / ARREADY  ","x":6510,"y":14928,"width":2640,"height":655,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"displayq","type":"text","text":"## J01 · 09 显示队列 / display_q\n\n模块复用 stream_async_fifo。  \n128 位 × 512 RAM 槽，另有一个读侧预取槽。  \n写侧 ui_clk；读侧 pixel_clk。  \nfifo_full 通过 rready 对读返回施加背压。  \n不存整帧，仅吸收 DDR 返回和扫描消费的短时差异。  ","x":110,"y":16643,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"pixels","type":"text","text":"## J02 · 10 顶层：全屏拆包与颜色扩展\n\nwindow=de，1280×720 整个有效区消费。  \nlane=0…7，取 dout[lane*16 +:16]；第八颗才 pop。  \nRGB565 → RGB888：R={R5,R5高3}；G={G6,G6高2}；B={B5,B5高3}。  \nRGB 与 HS/VS/DE 寄存一拍对齐。没有缩放器、ISP 或彩条切换器。  ","x":1630,"y":16643,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"timing","type":"text","text":"## J03 · video_timing / timing\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/video_timing.v`  \n\n输入 pixel_clk、pixel_reset；输出 hs/vs/de、x[10:0]、y[9:0]。  \nH：ACTIVE 1280 + FRONT 110 + SYNC 40 + BACK 220 = 1650。  \nV：ACTIVE 720 + FRONT 5 + SYNC 5 + BACK 20 = 750。  \n正极性 HS/VS；de=(h<1280 && v<720 && !reset)。  \nh_count 每像素递增，行尾清零并推进 v_count，帧尾归零。  ","x":1630,"y":17153,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"toggle","type":"text","text":"## J04 · 顶层：显示换帧事件\n\nvs_d 记上一拍 VSYNC；vs && !vs_d 时翻转 display_toggle。  \n这是持久翻转量，不是 UI 域容易漏掉的单周期脉冲。  \nreader 同步后比较 seen，更新 pending。  ","x":110,"y":17153,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"displayreset","type":"text","text":"## J05 · 显示 FIFO 与像素域复位\n\ndq_reset = ui_reset || display_fifo_reset || pixel_reset。  \n队列内部在写/读时钟域分别释放复位；display_reset_sync 在像素域释放 display_pixel_reset。  \n局部复位清 lane 和 display_bad，不停止 video_timing。  \n换帧通过 flush 重新开始，避免把旧帧预取数据当新帧像素。  ","x":110,"y":17678,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"displayconsume","type":"text","text":"## J06 · 像素消费：一拍拆 8 次\n\nconsume=window && !display_bad && !empty。  \ndisplay_pop=consume && lane==7。  \nwindow 内成功消费后 lane 自增；0…7 自然回绕。  \n消隐期保持 lane，不读 FIFO；一行 1280 像素正好 160 个 128 位拍。  ","x":1630,"y":17678,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"displayunderflow","type":"text","text":"## J07 · 显示供数不足如何恢复\n\nwindow 有效但 FIFO empty → display_bad=1。  \n此后当前显示帧剩余窗口输出黑色，不继续消费错位像素。  \n下一 VSYNC 或显示局部复位清 display_bad/lane，reader 重新预取。  \n这不是用 FIFO 深度改变屏幕的扫描速度。  ","x":1630,"y":18188,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"rgbdelay","type":"text","text":"## J08 · 顶层：RGB 和控制的时间对齐\n\n同一 pixel_clk 时钟沿：hs_reg<=hs，vs_reg<=vs，de_reg<=de。  \nconsume 且非 display_pixel_reset 时，按 lane 从 128 位字中取 RGB565 并扩位；否则 RGB=0。  \n这样控制信号与相应 RGB 同级寄存，送入 TMDS。  \nRGB 扩位不是插值或锐化，不增加空间分辨率。  ","x":110,"y":18188,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ref_J_0","type":"text","text":"## J · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nJ01 → J02：dout[127:0] / empty  \n\nJ01 → J05：复位支路  \n\nJ01 → J06：消费规则  \n\nJ02 → J08：输出寄存器  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nJ02 → K01：RGB / HS / VS / DE  \n\nJ01 → E03：另一个实例：128 位 / ADDR_BITS=9  \n\nJ07 → I02：下次 VSYNC 重新请求  \n\nJ04 → I02：跨域请求  ","x":110,"y":18698,"width":2640,"height":655,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"tx","type":"text","text":"## K01 · 11 dvi_tx / hdmi\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/dvi_tx.v`  \n\n输入 RGB888、HS/VS/DE。  \n时钟：pixel_clk、serial_clk_5x。  \n内部包含 RGB 编码、四个串行器和差分输出。  \n输出 tmds_data_p/n[2:0]、tmds_clk_p/n。  \nDVI 兼容视频，不发送音频和 HDMI 数据岛。  ","x":3310,"y":16643,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"encode_rgb","type":"text","text":"## K02 · tmds_encode_rgb / u_tmds_encode_rgb\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/tmds_encode_rgb.v`  \n\n将 R/G/B 各接一个 tmds_encoder，实现代码只存在一份。  \n有效区输入三个 8 位颜色值。  \n消隐区：红绿 c0/c1=0；蓝色 c0=HSYNC、c1=VSYNC。  \n输出 red_code/green_code/blue_code，各 10 位。  ","x":4830,"y":16643,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"encoder","type":"text","text":"## K03 · tmds_encoder ×3\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/tmds_encoder.v`  \n\n第一阶段为组合逻辑，生成 q_m[8:0]；第二阶段在像素时钟输出 tmds_out[9:0] 并更新有符号 disparity[5:0]。  \n三路颜色各有独立的 disparity 寄存器。  \n不把第一级组合逻辑误画为额外一拍流水。  ","x":4830,"y":17168,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"qm","type":"text","text":"## K04 · TMDS 第一阶段：减少翻转\n\n数 data_in 中的 1。  \n若 ones>4，或 ones==4 且 data[0]==0：使用逐位 XNOR，q_m[8]=0。  \n否则逐位 XOR，q_m[8]=1。q_m[0]=data[0]。  \nbalance=2×q_m[7:0] 中 1 的数量−8。  ","x":3310,"y":17168,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"disparity","type":"text","text":"## K05 · TMDS 第二阶段：直流平衡\n\ndisp=0 或 balance=0：bit9=~q_m[8]，bit8=q_m[8]；低8位按 q_m[8] 选择翻转，更新 ±balance。  \n若 disp 与 balance 同号：翻转低8位，bit9=1；disp -= balance，再按 q_m[8] 补偿 +2。  \n否则不翻转低8位，bit9=0；disp += balance，再按 q_m[8] 补偿 −2。  ","x":3310,"y":17678,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"controlcodes","type":"text","text":"## K06 · TMDS 消隐控制码\n\nde=0 时清 disparity，并按 {c1,c0} 输出：  \n00 → 1101010100  \n01 → 0010101011  \n10 → 0101010100  \n11 → 1010101011  \n蓝色通道因此传送行场同步，红绿发送固定 00 控制码。  ","x":4830,"y":17678,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"serializer","type":"text","text":"## K07 · serializer_10to1 ×4\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/serializer_10to1.v`  \n\n三路颜色 + 一路时钟，复用同一个模块实现。  \n输入每像素 10 位；MASTER/SLAVE OSERDESE2 通过专用 SHIFT 级联。  \nMASTER 提供低 8 位，SLAVE 补其余 2 位；按设计顺序从 bit0 开始发送。  \nserial_clk_5x 双沿输出：一个 pixel_clk 周期发送 10 位。  \n时钟通道固定字 1111100000。  ","x":4830,"y":18188,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"obuf","type":"text","text":"## K08 · OBUFDS：差分电气输出\n\n位于 dvi_tx 内的 Xilinx 原语，不是另一份手写模块。  \nblue→data[0]；green→data[1]；red→data[2]。  \n串行时钟→tmds_clk_p/n；IOSTANDARD=TMDS_33。  \n742.1875 Mb/s / 数据通道；差分时钟约 74.21875 MHz。  ","x":3310,"y":18188,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"monitor","type":"text","text":"## K09 · 12 HDMI2 → Dell 显示器\n\n接收三路 TMDS 数据与一路时钟。  \n1280×720 扫描，约 59.975 Hz。  \n显示刷新与摄像头帧率独立。  \n没有新完整帧时可重复显示上一帧。  ","x":3310,"y":18713,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ref_K_0","type":"text","text":"## K · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nK01 → K09：TMDS 差分对  \n\nK03 → K07：三路 10 位码字  ","x":3310,"y":19223,"width":2640,"height":250,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"sysreset","type":"text","text":"## L01 · 系统时钟与复位：顶层原语\n\nsys_clk Y9：50 MHz → 共享 BUFG → sys_clk50。  \nreset_n P17 低有效；system_reset_sync 三级寄存器。  \n异步置位、50 MHz 同步释放 sys_reset。  \n摄像头 PCLK Y18 → 独立 BUFG；它不由本地 PLL 产生。  ","x":6510,"y":16643,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"camclock","type":"text","text":"## L02 · camera_clock_reset / u_camera_clock_reset\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/camera_clock_reset.v`  \n\ncamera_clk IP：50 MHz → 24 MHz。  \nlocked/ready 同步到系统域后允许初始化。  \n顶层 ODDR 将 24 MHz 时钟转发到 camera_xclk AA18。  \n无新增 AF 时钟。  ","x":8030,"y":16643,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ddrclock","type":"text","text":"## L03 · ddr_clock_reset / u_ddr_clock_reset\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/ddr_clock_reset.v`  \n\nddr_clk IP：50 MHz → 200 MHz。  \n时钟未锁定时保持 MIG 复位；MIG 配置为高有效 sys_rst。  \nMIG 输出 ui_clk、ui_clk_sync_rst、mmcm_locked。  \naxi_reset_request 包含系统/MIG/锁定状态，本域同步释放 ui_reset；aresetn=!ui_reset。  ","x":8030,"y":17153,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"videoclock","type":"text","text":"## L04 · video_clock_reset / video_clock\n\n`cam_yolo.srcs/sources_1/new/video_clock_reset.v`  \n\nvideo_clk IP：50 MHz → 74.21875 MHz 与 371.09375 MHz。  \n二者 1:5；serial 时钟双沿发送 10 位。  \n系统复位或未锁定时保持 pixel_reset，同步释放到像素域。  ","x":6510,"y":17153,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"clockips","type":"text","text":"## L05 · 四个 IP 的实际输入文件\n\ncamera_live/ip/camera_clk/camera_clk.xci  \ncamera_live/ip/ddr_clk/ddr_clk.xci  \ncamera_live/ip/video_clk/video_clk.xci  \ncamera_live/ip/mig_7series_0/mig_7series_0.xci  \nAF 工程借用这些 IP；不应按“旧 camera_live 目录”删除。  \nMIG XML：camera_live/ip/mig_7series_0/mig_camera.prj。  ","x":6510,"y":17663,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ref_L_0","type":"text","text":"## L · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nL01 → L03：50 MHz / sys_reset  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nL02 → A01：ODDR：24 MHz XCLK  \n\nL03 → H02：200 MHz / MIG reset  \n\nL04 → K01：pixel / serial 时钟  \n\nL05 → H03：MIG 参数与引脚  \n\nL02 → A02：clock_ready / XCLK  \n\nL04 → J03：pixel_clk / reset  ","x":6510,"y":18173,"width":2640,"height":593,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"boardpins","type":"text","text":"## M01 · 板级引脚：摄像头 / HDMI / 系统\n\n输入文件 constraints/camera_hdmi.xdc；下列为当前实际 PACKAGE_PIN。  \n\nsys_clk → Y9  \nreset_n → P17  \ncamera_pclk → Y18  \ncamera_href → T21  \ncamera_vsync → U21  \ncamera_sda → T22  \ncamera_scl → U22  \ncamera_xclk → AA18  \ncamera_data[0] → U17  \ncamera_data[1] → V17  \ncamera_data[2] → Y20  \ncamera_data[3] → Y21  \ncamera_data[4] → V18  \ncamera_data[5] → V19  \ncamera_data[6] → W20  \ncamera_data[7] → W21  \nled[0] → N22  \nled[1] → P22  \nled[2] → R18  \nled[3] → T18  \ntmds_clk_p → Y6  \ntmds_clk_n → Y5  \ntmds_data_p[0] → Y4  \ntmds_data_n[0] → AA4  \ntmds_data_p[1] → AB5  \ntmds_data_n[1] → AB4  \ntmds_data_p[2] → AB7  \ntmds_data_n[2] → AB6  \n\n摄像头单端及系统输入 LVCMOS33；HDMI 差分 TMDS_33。RST/PWDN 不按旧 TFT 示例错误分配到 N20。  ","x":110,"y":20183,"width":1120,"height":1833,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ddrpins","type":"text","text":"## M02 · DDR 引脚与电气：自动读取配置\n\n来自 camera_live/ip/mig_7series_0/mig_camera.prj 的 PinSelection。  \n\nddr3_addr[0] → F17 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[10] → A16 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[11] → C19 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[12] → B16 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[13] → E18 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[1] → C18 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[2] → F18 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[3] → G17 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[4] → D17 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[5] → F16 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[6] → D18 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[7] → G15 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[8] → D16 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_addr[9] → E16 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_ba[0] → G16 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_ba[1] → C17 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_ba[2] → A17 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_cas_n → A18 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_ck_n[0] → D15 (DIFF_SSTL135)  \nddr3_ck_p[0] → E15 (DIFF_SSTL135)  \nddr3_cke[0] → B15 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_cs_n[0] → H17 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dm[0] → H22 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dm[1] → D20 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[0] → G21 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[10] → B20 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[11] → C22 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[12] → B21 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[13] → B22 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[14] → C20 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[15] → D22 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[1] → H20 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[2] → G20 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[3] → F22 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[4] → H19 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[5] → F19 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[6] → F21 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[7] → G22 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[8] → D21 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dq[9] → E21 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_dqs_n[0] → E20 (DIFF_SSTL135)  \nddr3_dqs_n[1] → A22 (DIFF_SSTL135)  \nddr3_dqs_p[0] → E19 (DIFF_SSTL135)  \nddr3_dqs_p[1] → A21 (DIFF_SSTL135)  \nddr3_odt[0] → C15 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_ras_n → A19 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_reset_n → H18 (SSTL135)  \nddr3_we_n → B17 (SSTL135)  \nsys_rst → No connect (None)  \ninit_calib_complete → No connect (None)  \ntg_compare_error → No connect (None)  \n\n对应 Bank35 1.35 V；MIG 内部延迟、DQS 与采样校准由 IP 管理，不逐条当普通 GPIO 使用。  ","x":1630,"y":20183,"width":1120,"height":1833,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"xdc","type":"text","text":"## M03 · 约束：哪些确定，哪些只是预算\n\n`constraints/camera_hdmi.xdc`  \n\nsys_clk 周期 20 ns。camera_pclk 周期也约束为 20 ns，但不是实测。  \n摄像头数据/HREF/VSYNC 的输入延迟预算 min0、max8 ns，尚无示波器校准。  \nY18 非专用时钟管脚：仅对 camera_pclk_IBUF 设置 CLOCK_DEDICATED_ROUTE FALSE。  \nSDA、复位、LED 等有专门假路径；Gray 同步首级 max_delay=5ns。  \n保留的 LUTAR/其他方法学告警不等于已全部解决；不把时序通过当电气和光学证明。  ","x":1630,"y":22196,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ref_M_0","type":"text","text":"## M · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nM01 → A01：板级接线  \n\nM02 → H03：DDR PinSelection  ","x":110,"y":22721,"width":2640,"height":283,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"entry","type":"text","text":"## N01 · 阅读方法与内容边界\n\n上方先看三级金字塔，六个功能区同时构成横向数据流。下方 A～N 为模块与内部逻辑，O 为缓存握手专项图。  \n每张详细卡片有唯一编号，跨分区关系只写编号和接口，不画穿越正文的长线。蓝色数据、绿色控制、橙色时钟复位、红色异常。  \n主体系概述，详细模块正文只在所属卡片出现一次；不依赖图片或额外页面。  ","x":3310,"y":20183,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"parameters","type":"text","text":"## N02 · 统一参数：各模块引用此卡\n\nIMAGE_WIDTH=1280；IMAGE_HEIGHT=720  \nFRAME_PIXELS=921600；input_pixels 为 20 位  \nRGB565：每像素 2 字节；FRAME_BYTES=1843200  \n128 位 AXI：8 像素/拍；FRAME_BEATS=115200  \n三缓存间距 2 MiB，共预留 6 MiB  \n地址：0、0x200000、0x400000  \n摄像头 PCLK 未实测，不能把 XDC 的 50 MHz 包络当实际频率。  ","x":4830,"y":20183,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"status","type":"text","text":"## N03 · 实物进度：不要混淆三种成功\n\n已确认：摄像头出图；手动调焦后清晰改善。  \n当前 AF 位流 JTAG 下载成功，startup HIGH。  \n板上观察：LED 0/1/2 亮、3 灭，没有感觉到自动调焦。  \n这表示固件就绪并报告 0x10，不证明镜头移动或光学对焦成功。  \n本版每次启动只执行一次 AF，focus_start 接 0，不会持续追焦。  ","x":4830,"y":20708,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"delivery","type":"text","text":"## N04 · 当前工程、位流与资源\n\n工程：camera_af/camera_af.xpr  \n顶层：camera_hdmi_af_top  \n唯一 bit：delivery/upgrades/autofocus_20261109/camera_hdmi_af_top.bit  \nLUT 7427/53200 = 13.96%；FF 8175/106400 = 7.68%  \nBRAM36 等效 4.5/140 = 3.21%；DSP 0/220  \nWNS +0.970 ns；WHS +0.054 ns；TNS/THS 0  \nMMCM 4/4；PLL 1/4；BUFG 10/32。  ","x":3310,"y":20708,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"top","type":"text","text":"## N05 · 板级连接与顶层职责\n\n`rtl/camera_af/camera_hdmi_af_top.v`  \n\n将图像参数传给摄像头、packer、writer、reader；设置三帧基址。  \n本文件内部实现入口状态机、像素计数、显示请求 toggle、显示 FIFO、RGB 拆包、LED。它们不是独立 .v 文件。  \n实例：cam、capture、ingress、manager、packer、ddr、writer、timing、reader、display_q、hdmi。  ","x":3310,"y":21233,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"afled","type":"text","text":"## N06 · AF 当前实物反馈与 LED\n\nled={af_error,af_success,af_ready,camera_done}。  \n0 图像配置成功；1 固件就绪；2 固件状态 0x10；3 AF 错误。  \n板上反馈 LED 012 亮、3 灭，但未感到镜头自动调整。  \n可能已接近合焦，也可能 VCM 不存在或连接不匹配；尚无证据择一。  \n光学验收需要明显失焦的目标在重新触发后自行变清晰，而不是只观察寄存器。  \n不要把旧 DVP 调试位流的 VSYNC/PCLK/SOF/像素灯定义用于本版。  ","x":4830,"y":21233,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"failure_map","type":"text","text":"## N07 · 异常出口总览：按来源追踪\n\n初始化错误：停在 ST_ERROR，图像 init_done 不成立。  \nAF 错误：FAILED 保留，图像 init_done 保持，不影响已放行的视频。  \n入口溢出：当前帧后续字节丢弃，下一 SOF 恢复。  \n提前 SOF：入口 DRAIN，writer 结束在途事务后回 SEEK。  \n写响应/格式错误：帧计入 failed，不发布。  \n读错误或供数不足：不拿错位数据填满屏幕，下一显示请求重试。  \nwriter 非法 default 分支只置 frame_error，不保证完成或自动恢复，需系统协调复位；不是已证明的黑屏根因。  ","x":4830,"y":21743,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"verification","type":"text","text":"## N08 · 验证证据和限制\n\nverification/camera_af/tb_camera_af.v + run_checks.ps1：实际 SCCB 主机，252 图像写、4077 固件字节、MCU/命令轮询及 NACK 保留图像状态。  \n720p 升级曾逐像素核对三张显示帧；DDR/时钟/传感器配置/TMDS 使用模型或替身，不等于全链路物理认证。  \n硬件：JTAG 成功、012 亮3灭；尚未见自动调焦效果。  \n没有再次烧录，也没有在本次文档合并中修改 HDL。  ","x":3310,"y":21743,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"support","type":"text","text":"## N09 · 复现、固件来源和阶段边界\n\n当前构建/下载/报告：delivery/upgrades/autofocus_20261109/。  \nbuild.tcl 可重建 AF 工程；program_af.tcl 仅 JTAG 易失配置。  \nscripts/bitstream_timing_guard.tcl：生成 bit 前要求建立/保持 slack 非负。  \nscripts/prepare_af_firmware.py：从固定上游头文件校验并生成 ROM。  \n旧 ov5640_control/config/init_ctrl、彩条顶层和 FIFO Generator 不在当前 AF 路径。  \n工程目录只保留当前 AF bit；旧产物已移出，不从旧 delivery 路径下载。  ","x":3310,"y":22268,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"source_links","type":"text","text":"## N10 · 参考资料：只保留外部来源链接\n\n[固定上游提交](https://github.com/espressif/esp32-camera/tree/281d951f75b6559adec3cdb8cf076366da103880)  \n\n[OV5640 嵌入式固件用户指南](https://cdn-learn.adafruit.com/assets/assets/000/126/084/original/ov5640-firmware-user-guide.pdf)  \n\n上游参考文件和 LICENSE 已在 third_party/ov5640_af/ 保留；不以通用芯片手册代替实物电机型号确认。  \n当前 bit SHA256：2481e4c9d7054b6720a8fc227fc4253b0939b1ddb8e37307a055036965c359b4。  ","x":4830,"y":22268,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ref_N_0","type":"text","text":"## N · 条件、回环与跨区接口 1\n\nN06 → N04：当前构建结果  \n\nN08 → N03：已验证范围  \n\nN09 → N04：工程入口  \n\n跨分区接口（按编号定位，不画穿越正文的长线）：  \n\nN02 → F01：统一帧长  \n\nN02 → H01：统一缓存地址  \n\nN05 → A02：摄像头控制实例  \n\nN07 → F06：对应入口中止  \n\nN10 → C02：固件来源  ","x":3310,"y":22778,"width":2640,"height":655,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"o_writer","type":"text","text":"## O1 · 写入器（对应 G01）\n\n收到 wstart/wbase 开始写帧。  \n完成时返回 wdone/werror。  \n具体状态和 AXI 细节只在 G 区展开。  ","x":110,"y":24143,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"o_manager","type":"text","text":"## O2 · 帧管理器（对应 H01）\n\n为写端预留 FREE；为读端选择完整 READY。  \n显示确认之前不释放旧 DISPLAY。  \n具体归属转换只在 H 区展开。  ","x":1630,"y":24143,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"o_reader","type":"text","text":"## O3 · 读出器（对应 I01）\n\n旧事务排完、旧预取清理后请求新帧。  \n配置握手确认后才开始读取新缓存。  \n具体读状态只在 I 区展开。  ","x":3150,"y":24143,"width":1120,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"p_store","type":"text","text":"## 缓存完整帧\n\n打包并写入 DDR；三缓冲隔离采集、待显示和正在显示的帧。  ","x":3250,"y":770,"width":1100,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p_show","type":"text","text":"## 输出画面\n\n安全换帧和预取；按固定扫描速度消费像素，编码发送到 HDMI。  ","x":5850,"y":770,"width":1100,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"root_fork","type":"text","text":"","x":3794,"y":574,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p_show_port","type":"text","text":"","x":6394,"y":574,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"subfork0","type":"text","text":"","x":1194,"y":1214,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"subfork0_0","type":"text","text":"","x":544,"y":1214,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"subfork0_1","type":"text","text":"","x":1844,"y":1214,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p_root","type":"text","text":"## 系统：OV5640 → DDR3L → HDMI2\n\n目标：原生 1280×720 持续显示；附加单次 AF 候选控制。  \n主工程 camera_af；根模块 camera_hdmi_af_top。  \n下层横向箭头是像素数据；上下连线是结构包含关系。  \n当前 AF 012 亮、3 灭；镜头自动调整尚未确认。  \n参数/资源/来源集中在 N 区；公共时钟和引脚见 L/M 区。  ","x":3100,"y":0,"width":1400,"height":430,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"## ① 摄像头与控制\n\n功能：让传感器输出正确格式。  \n输入：24 MHz XCLK、SCCB 命令。  \n输出：DVP 字节、PCLK、VSYNC、HREF。  \n详细：A 图像初始化、B SCCB、C/D AF。  ","x":0,"y":1410,"width":1100,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"## ② DVP 采集与跨域\n\n功能：两字节拼 RGB565，携带 SOF 跨时钟。  \n输入：8 位 DVP。输出：17 位队列项。  \n满时丢弃当前帧剩余像素，下帧恢复。  \n详细：E 采集/FIFO。  ","x":1300,"y":1410,"width":1100,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"## ③ 打包与 AXI 写\n\n功能：申请缓存，按完整帧组织 AXI 写入。  \n输入：16 位像素+SOF；输出：128 位 AXI。  \n8 像素/拍，最多 16 拍/突发。  \n详细：F 对齐打包、G 写状态。  ","x":2600,"y":1410,"width":1100,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"## ④ 三缓冲与 DDR\n\n功能：储存并发布完整帧，不覆盖当前显示区。  \n三个 2 MiB 区域；一帧 1843200 字节。  \n写成功才 READY，显示确认后才切换归属。  \n详细：H 帧管理/DDR；L/M 时钟引脚。  ","x":3900,"y":1410,"width":1100,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"## ⑤ 读出与像素供数\n\n功能：换帧前排完旧事务，清预取后读新帧。  \n128 位队列跨到像素域，拆成 RGB888。  \n显示供数不足时本帧余下输出黑色，下帧重试。  \n详细：I AXI 读、J 扫描拆包。  ","x":5200,"y":1410,"width":1100,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"## ⑥ TMDS 与屏幕\n\n功能：按扫描时序输出 DVI 兼容视频。  \n三路 8→10 位编码，四路 10:1 串行化。  \nOBUFDS → HDMI2 → Dell 显示器。  \n详细：K 编码与物理输出。  ","x":6500,"y":1410,"width":1100,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"subfork1","type":"text","text":"","x":3794,"y":1214,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"subfork1_2","type":"text","text":"","x":3144,"y":1214,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p_get","type":"text","text":"## 获取图像\n\n配置与控制传感器，识别帧边界，把像素安全送入用户时钟域。  ","x":650,"y":770,"width":1100,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"p_get_port","type":"text","text":"","x":1194,"y":574,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"subfork1_3","type":"text","text":"","x":4444,"y":1214,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"subfork2","type":"text","text":"","x":6394,"y":1214,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"subfork2_4","type":"text","text":"","x":5744,"y":1214,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"subfork2_5","type":"text","text":"","x":7044,"y":1214,"width":12,"height":12,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"imageinit","type":"text","text":"## A03 · ov5640_init_bus_ctrl / image_init\n\n`rtl/camera_af/ov5640_init_bus_ctrl.v`  \n\n保留原初始化算法，只将 SCCB 实例提取为事务接口。  \n输出 bus_reset/start/read/addr/write_data，输入 busy/done/nack/read_data。  \nCLK=50 MHz；RESET_HOLD 5 ms；STARTUP 20 ms；软复位等待 5 ms；每项写后 100 μs；事务限时 10 ms。  \n先读 0x300A/B=0x5640，再写 252 项。  ","x":1630,"y":2995,"width":1120,"height":345,"color":"4"}
	],
